---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Placeholder from '../components/Placeholder.astro';
import EnquiryForm from '../components/EnquiryForm.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Layout
  title="About Cheshire Stoneworks: worktop templaters and fitters, Lymm"
  description="Cheshire Stoneworks is a worktop template-and-install company in Lymm, Cheshire. Two install teams, four templaters, and years of fitting for the national kitchen retailers. Now working direct for homeowners."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container about">
      <div class="prose">
        <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
        <h1>We fit worktops. That is the whole business.</h1>
        <p class="lead">
          Cheshire Stoneworks is a template-and-install company based in Lymm. For most of our history
          the customer has been a kitchen retailer or a stone fabricator, not a homeowner. We are the
          team they send to your house.
        </p>
        <p>
          That work is done to a standard set by other people, checked by other people, and measured by
          how often we have to go back. It has made us good at the two things that decide whether a
          worktop install goes well: the template, and the fit.
        </p>
        <p>
          This site is us doing the same job direct. Same templaters, same fitters, same suppliers.
          You deal with us from the first phone call to the last wipe-down.
        </p>

        <h2>Who you will meet</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Two install teams, two fitters each.</li>
          <li>Four templaters.</li>
          <li>One operations manager, who books the visits and answers the phone.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="muted">[TODO: names and short bios if you want them on the page. Photos of the team and vans go alongside.]</p>

        <h2>Credentials</h2>
        <p class="muted">
          [TODO: credentials. List only what is real and current: public liability insurance and its
          cover level, any manufacturer-approved installer status (for example Caesarstone, Silestone
          or Cosentino approved fabricator or installer), trade body memberships, DBS checks if you hold
          them. Do not list anything we cannot show a certificate for.]
        </p>

        <h2>Our guarantee</h2>
        <p>{site.guarantee.summary}. {site.guarantee.remedy}.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="about__photos">
        <Placeholder caption="The team, on site" ratio="4 / 3" />
        <Placeholder caption="One of our vans" ratio="4 / 3" />
        <Placeholder caption="Templating equipment in use" ratio="4 / 3" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--teal">
    <div class="container">
      <EnquiryForm />
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .about__photos {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 56rem) {
    .about {
      grid-template-columns: 3fr 2fr;
    }
    .about__photos {
      position: sticky;
      top: 5.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
